/Title (The primary reason flyers should have limited text is because of the available space. The limited area, often only one full or half-page, must be used efficiently. Flyers are also intended to be viewed quickly or in passing. A common place to display flyers is in a hallway. This means flyers should catch attention instantly and provide easily digestable information.)
/Dest [38 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2607 0 R
>>
endobj
