2617 0 obj
<<
/Title (Printed flyers should not feature many words.  Full sentences may be replaced with bullet points or lists as appropriate. Flyer designs should focus on graphic elements to convey ideas with text used to clarify details.)
/Dest [38 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2613 0 R
/Next 2618 0 R
>>
endobj
2618 0 obj
<<
